  "description": "Proposed works to Gasholder No.2 (Grade II* listed) comprising: (i) bell and tank wall stabilisation works including concrete pours; (ii) the recording, dismantling and off-site refurbishment and restoration of the existing structure, (iii) fabrication of replacement components where the original components are degraded beyond repair, and (iv) repainting and re-erection of restored and fabricated components of the gasholder in a new configuration and with required alterations to facilitate the use of the gasholder as an integrated feature of the wider landscaped park, including introduction of a water feature and new seating and other associated works. (AMENDED DESCRIPTION)",
